        h3 Amazon Delivery Driver
        p This is a delivery driver job for Amazon. You will visit customers' homes and deliver packages. If the customer is absent, you can leave the package at the door, allowing you to work efficiently.
        .row 
         .col-sm-6
          p
           strong Monthly Salary:
           | 350,000 JPY
         .col-sm-6
          p
          strong Job Type:
          | Light Cargo Driver
        .row 
         .col-sm-6
          p
           strong Working Hours:
           | 07:00~20:00
         .col-sm-6
          p
          strong Holidays:
          | 6 days off per month
        .row 
         .col-sm-6
          p
           strong Contract Type:
           | Outsourcing Contract
         .col-sm-6
          p
          strong Work Location:
          | Tokyo
        .row 
         .col-sm-6
          p
           strong Training Period:
           | 3 months
         .col-sm-6
          p
          strong Training Salary:
          | 300,000 JPY
        .row 
         .col-sm-6
          p
           strong Visa Eligibility:
           | Permanent Resident Visa
         .col-sm-6
          p
          strong Required License:
          | Standard Driver's License
        .row 
